WEBVTT

00:08:29.421 --> 00:08:32.383
Giving with an abundance
of heart and of spirit.

00:08:32.883 --> 00:08:38.264
We can all be radically generous
in so many ways,

00:08:38.264 --> 00:08:39.723
beyond just money.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.394
So after tonight,

00:08:43.435 --> 00:08:48.065
we all are going to go
and volunteer and advocate

00:08:48.107 --> 00:08:50.901
and open doors and share in social media.

00:08:51.777 --> 00:08:54.989
We call this, in giving circles,
giving your five Ts:

00:08:56.031 --> 00:08:57.366
time,

00:08:57.366 --> 00:08:58.659
talent,

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:00.035
treasure,